1
00:00:00,759 --> 00:00:03,549
(Penny:)Why don't you come over next Saturday
and watch the game?

2
00:00:04,221 --> 00:00:06,261
(Leonard:)Another football game?

3
00:00:06,681 --> 00:00:08,101
(Penny:)They have them every week.

4
00:00:08,433 --> 00:00:10,393
(Leonard:)Did not know that.

5
00:00:11,103 --> 00:00:13,103
(Penny:)-You wanted to meet my friends.
-Sure.

6
00:00:13,271 --> 00:00:15,311
(Penny:)Just--
I don't know much about football.

7
00:00:15,482 --> 00:00:17,562
(Penny:)The guys' girlfriends
don't know football.

8
00:00:17,734 --> 00:00:20,154
(Penny:)They just kind of drink
and talk in the kitchen.

9
00:00:21,655 --> 00:00:23,485
(Leonard:)Great.

10
00:00:25,742 --> 00:00:27,742
COMMENTATOR [ON TV]:
Looking left, he's got nothing.

11
00:00:27,911 --> 00:00:31,001
-He drops off a screen, out of bounds--
-Okay, a completed pass.

12
00:00:31,164 --> 00:00:33,664
(Leonard:)First down, New England.

13
00:00:35,293 --> 00:00:38,043
(Leonard:)-I think I'm starting to get this.
-Really?

14
00:00:38,213 --> 00:00:41,753
The only thing I've learned is that
American men love drinking beer...

15
00:00:41,925 --> 00:00:45,015
(Raj:)...pee too often,
and have trouble getting erections.

16
00:00:48,682 --> 00:00:51,972
(Leonard:)Focus on the game,
not the commercials, Raj.

17
00:00:52,144 --> 00:00:55,274
If people cut back on the beer,
you could get out the bathroom...

18
00:00:55,439 --> 00:01:00,019
(Raj:)...and satisfy your women
without pharmaceutical help.

